            "review_title": "Review at Quán Trọng Hà",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nTwice in Two Days Good!\nJul 2020\nI'm not one to return to restaurants I've already been to when traveling. I generally like to hit up as many new options as I can. But, this place was a must-return. If you're looking for local flavor and a local experience, this place is excellent. It is, what most westerners would call \"street food\" though it really isn't...it's just served in an informal environment. This place is always packed which is usually a good sign for a restaurant. As a rule, I tend to avoid empty places. This place was turning away customers when we were there for dinner. \n\nThe service is hurried and while it doesn't seem \"friendly,\" it's very normal for this sort of restaurant. But, when we went back the next day, multiple servers remembered us and brought us a bucket of ice - like we'd asked for the day before. The seafood options here are the best. My hands-down favorite was the grilled oysters. \n\nSo, if you're in Ha Long and are looking to join the locals - this is the place to go.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 30, 2020",
